    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d463-a2">

                <pb facs="0572" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg504"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Austro-Hungarian Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Burian</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Austro-Hungarian Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Zwiedinek</hi>)</head>
                <p>You should tell the Secretary of State that always anxious to insure the practice
                    of firm principles of humanity and wishing to conform to the averred rules of
                    international law we quite agree with the United States Government that all
                    consequences to be drawn from the <hi rendition="#italic">Ancona</hi> case
                    depend on the <hi rendition="#italic">quaestio facti</hi> viz on authentical and
                    exact information how the sinking of the steamer took place. A statement
                    containing this information and based on reports of the Austro-Hungarian
                    admiralty will be handed over to Mr. Penfield in a few days in answer to his
                    letter of the 1 inst.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burian</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
